  "title": "The transcript prefix is Whisper’s task interface",
  "introduction": "Let $x$ denote one audio segment, $h=\\mathrm{Enc}(x)$ its contextual acoustic representation, and $p_t$ the ordered decoder prefix available before output step $t$. The example requests English transcription without timestamps. Whisper retains $h$ while the autoregressive prefix grows through a start marker, a predicted language identity, task and format controls, and transcript tokens.",
