  "takeaway": "The invariant is $p_{t+1}=p_t\\mathbin{\\|}y_t$: each selected token is appended without reordering the existing prefix. The acoustic representation $h$ remains available throughout, while the growing language, task, format, and transcript history determines the information available for each subsequent autoregressive prediction.",
